request:
Plan: two-part assembly, steel (steel_generic) bar from x=0 to 50 and aluminium (al_6061_t6) bar from x=50 to 100, both 10 x 10 mm, bonded (tie) at x=50. Steel end at x=0 is fixed, the aluminium end at x=100 is pulled with 5000 N along +X. Stretch is checked against the sum of the two axial bar elongations (P L / A E for each).
```json
{
  "name": "bonded steel-aluminium bars",
  "parts": [
    {"name": "steel", "material": "steel_generic",
     "geometry": {"template": "beam", "params": {"length": 50, "width": 10, "height": 10}}},
    {"name": "aluminium", "material": "al_6061_t6",
     "geometry": {"template": "beam", "params": {"length": 50, "width": 10, "height": 10},
                  "position": [50, 0, 0]}}
  ],
  "sets": {
    "fixed": {"part": "steel", "plane": "x", "at": 0},
    "joint_a": {"part": "steel", "plane": "x", "at": 50},
    "joint_b": {"part": "aluminium", "plane": "x", "at": 50},
    "tip": {"part": "aluminium", "plane": "x", "at": 100}
  },
  "interactions": [{"type": "tie", "master": "joint_a", "slave": "joint_b"}],
  "analysis": {"type": "static"},
  "constraints": [{"type": "fixed", "on": "fixed"}],
  "loads": [{"type": "force", "on": "tip", "value": [5000, 0, 0]}],
  "hand_calcs": [
    {"calc": "axial.bar", "params": {"P": 5000, "L": 50, "A": 100, "E": "210GPa"}},
    {"calc": "axial.bar", "params": {"P": 5000, "L": 50, "A": 100, "E": "69GPa"}}
  ]
}
```
